{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vox in Tenebris</strong> is a short first-person exploration horror game. As an archivist-priest, make your way into a forgotten catacomb, repel spirits, and find its secrets before your lantern fades out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/c6c1bdaf7f4ad1f82548262dde0d833e.poster.avif?t=1752617241\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/c6c1bdaf7f4ad1f82548262dde0d833e.webm?t=1752617241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/c6c1bdaf7f4ad1f82548262dde0d833e.mp4?t=1752617241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The year is 1357. The High Order has been called, and you are sent as an archivist to explore a cursed crypt. The light of your lantern will be your guide, and your faith your sword. What forbidden knowledge will you find? Will you return? Your carriage slows down while you say a last prayer: Vade protecte vox in tenebris.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/8532640f419a0bdbef92e6228644f599.poster.avif?t=1752617241\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/8532640f419a0bdbef92e6228644f599.webm?t=1752617241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/8532640f419a0bdbef92e6228644f599.mp4?t=1752617241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An excavation has been discovered in the basement of a countryside church. It will lead you\u00a0to unsuspected\u00a0deep places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Banish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/69842582ea65d7d2eeac3ea8a8fc7c7c.poster.avif?t=1752617241\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/69842582ea65d7d2eeac3ea8a8fc7c7c.webm?t=1752617241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/69842582ea65d7d2eeac3ea8a8fc7c7c.mp4?t=1752617241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use prayers to repel spirits, but beware of unfinished adjurations; doing them too soon will be ineffective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep your lantern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/394f743e43a14e554b0f3ac99a3d93c6.poster.avif?t=1752617241\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/394f743e43a14e554b0f3ac99a3d93c6.webm?t=1752617241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/394f743e43a14e554b0f3ac99a3d93c6.mp4?t=1752617241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not let your lantern extinguish, or the darkness will devour you. Find candles and anticipate your movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/50159b77459b762d7f537dbb38c0acbf.poster.avif?t=1752617241\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/50159b77459b762d7f537dbb38c0acbf.webm?t=1752617241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/extras/50159b77459b762d7f537dbb38c0acbf.mp4?t=1752617241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel places and secrets, but shall they be exhumed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648710?t=1752617241","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648710?t=1752617241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/c850d97668af1f0429e35b834ca07faf1d34cda7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752617241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648710/c850d97668af1f0429e35b834ca07faf1d34cda7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752617241","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"As a dark medieval theme, the game shows blood, murders and suggestions of torture."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vox in Tenebris</strong> is a short first-person exploration horror game. As an archivist-priest, make your way into a forgotten catacomb, repel spirits, and find its secrets before your lantern fades out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\